CreatePricedRound_Rounds_Unit_Concrete_Test
├── when the caller is not the Safe
│   └── it should revert with OnlyBoard
├── when the price or the maximum shares is 0 or the pay by date is past
│   └── it should revert with InvalidRound
├── when the class does not exist
│   └── it should revert with UnknownClass
└── when the round is valid
    ├── it should record the priced round
    └── it should emit PricedRoundCreated
